{
  "description": "This protocol performs a sample consolidation from .csv file. The file should be organized in the following way including header line:\nPlate Position,Source Well ID,Destination Tube ID,Volume,,\n1,A1,A1,3.0,,\n1,B1,A1,4.0,,\n1,C1,B1,5.0,,\n1,D1,A1,3.0,,\n...\nEmpty lines are ignored. You can download a template file here.\nThe destination tube for all sources will be a specified location (A1-D6) of the custom tuberack in slot 9.\n\n\n\nAbgene 96-Well Microplates 330µl (ThermoFisher #AB0796)\nAxygen™ 96-well PCR Microplates, barcoded 200µl #14-222-327\nAbgene™ 96 Well 2.2mL Polypropylene Deepwell Storage Plate\nOpentrons P20 GEN2 single-channel electronic pipette\nOpentrons 20µl tipracks\nVWR 5ml tubes seated in Opentrons 3x5 tuberack",
  "tags": [
    "Sample Prep",
    "Consolidation"
  ],
  "labware": [
    {
      "name": "20µl tiprack on 1",
      "slot": "1",
      "type": "lab_opentrons_96_tiprack_20ul"
    },
    {
      "name": "plate 1 on 2",
      "slot": "2",
      "type": "lab_abgene_96_wellplate_330ul_round"
    },
    {
      "name": "20µl tiprack on 3",
      "slot": "3",
      "type": "lab_opentrons_96_tiprack_20ul"
    },
    {
      "name": "20µl tiprack on 4",
      "slot": "4",
      "type": "lab_opentrons_96_tiprack_20ul"
    },
    {
